---
import DefaultPageLayout from "../../layouts/DefaultPageLayout.astro";
import Petapetual from "../../components/Petapetual.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<DefaultPageLayout
    title="For Busy People"
    description="Today's world demands a lot of your time and attention, but why should you have to compromise on paying respects to your late loved ones? Petapetual was created to make remembrance more convenient in the modern age."
>
    <article class="article-container">
        <a href="/examples" class="back-link">
            <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> All Use Cases
        </a>

        <Image
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620809975674-10b8ff5f8e58?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=2070"
            alt="Life can get busy and hectic, and this can mean it becomes difficult to take a moment to pay respects or remember those that have passed on. Petapetual is a convenient online solution to help with this. Access your memorials anytime, anywhere."
            class="article-hero"
            width="2070"
            height="400"
        />

        <h1 class="article-title">
            <Petapetual /> for the busy
        </h1>

        <p class="article-text">
            Today's world constantly demands your attention. From studies, to
            work, to social commitments; it can be hard to balance building your
            own life with making time to remember those who have passed.
            <Petapetual /> makes remembrance easier in the modern age, fitting seamlessly
            into your busy schedule.
        </p>

        <h2 class="article-subtitle">Always available when you need it</h2>

        <p class="article-text">
            When you create a <a class="article-link" href="/how-it-works"
                >memorial</a
            > for your late loved one on <Petapetual />, we take care of
            everything for you so that you can focus on what's important. Your
            memorial will be accessible online 24/7 from anywhere, and any
            device. No app installation needed, just sign in and pay your
            respects.
        </p>

        <h2 class="article-subtitle">Virtual prayers when you are away</h2>

        <p class="article-text">
            All memorials on paid plans come with a 24/7 <a
                class="article-link"
                href="/how-it-works#prayer-streams">virtualized prayer</a
            > service. Rest easy knowing that even when you are going about your
            busy day, your online memorial is receiving your prayers and blessings.
        </p>

        <div class="article-cta">
            <a href="https://app.petapetual.com" class="cta-btn">
                Create a Memorial <i class="fas fa-arrow-right ml-1"></i>
            </a>
        </div>
    </article>
</DefaultPageLayout>

<style>
    @reference "tailwindcss";

    .article-container {
        @apply flex flex-col gap-6;
    }

    .back-link {
        @apply text-sm no-underline transition-colors;
        color: var(--color-pp-mid);
    }

    .back-link:hover {
        color: var(--color-pp-primary);
    }

    .article-hero {
        @apply w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-sm;
        @apply lg:h-72;
    }

    .article-title {
        @apply text-2xl font-bold;
        @apply lg:text-3xl;
        color: var(--color-pp-primary);
    }

    .article-subtitle {
        @apply text-xl font-semibold mt-2;
        color: var(--color-pp-primary);
    }

    .article-text {
        @apply leading-relaxed;
        color: var(--color-pp-dark);
    }

    .article-link {
        @apply underline transition-colors;
        color: var(--color-pp-primary);
        text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-pp-primary) 50%, transparent);
    }

    .article-link:hover {
        text-decoration-color: var(--color-pp-primary);
    }

    .article-cta {
        @apply mt-4 py-8 text-center;
        border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-pp-mid) 30%, transparent);
    }

    .cta-btn {
        @apply inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold no-underline transition-colors;
        background-color: var(--color-pp-primary);
        color: var(--color-pp-light);
    }

    .cta-btn:hover {
        opacity: 0.9;
    }
</style>
